{"id": "141287", "name": "ערכים עצמיים ולכסינות - טענות כלליות - 18", "qtype": "truefalse", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 1, "options": {}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\">\n<div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div>\n<p>תהא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\in M_{n\\times n}(\\mathbb{F})\\)</span> מטריצה. אזי:</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\">\n<p>אם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span> לכסינה ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^k=0\\)</span> לאיזשהו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(k\\)</span> טבעי, אז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A=0\\)</span>.</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"native-answer\">[[input:ans]]</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> נלכסן את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span>: החזקה מתאפסת רק אם כל הערכים על האלכסון אפס.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — לכסון</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A=PDP^{-1}\\)</span> עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(D=\\mathrm{diag}(d_1,\\dots,d_n)\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P\\)</span> הפיכה. אז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^k=PD^kP^{-1}\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — מסקנה</b><br>מ-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^k=0\\)</span> נקבל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(D^k=P^{-1}A^kP=0\\)</span>, כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(d_i^k=0\\)</span> לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(i\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(d_i=0\\)</span> (בשדה אין מחלקי אפס). לכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(D=0\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A=P\\cdot 0\\cdot P^{-1}=0\\)</span>.<p style=\"text-align:center\"><b>הטענה נכונה.</b></p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "radio", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": false, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "native": {"shuffle": false, "numbering": "none", "instruction": "one", "lang": "he"}}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "native": true, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": []}], "qvnames": [], "nvariants": 1}